Third-party assets

The rover meshes and texture atlas are NASA/JPL-Caltech's, from the
m2020-urdf-models release (https://github.com/nasa-jpl/m2020-urdf-models).
They are not included in this repository: setup.sh downloads that release and
converts it locally, and the files remain subject to NASA/JPL's terms. The
model geometry and camera placements in the MJCF are derived from the same
release. The Jezero terrain is derived from the HiRISE stereo DTM
DTEEC_045994_1985_046060_1985_U01 and the Gale terrain from
DTEEC_018854_1755_018920_1755_U01 (both NASA/JPL/University of Arizona/USGS).
The MIT license above covers only the code and documentation written for this
project.
